        "@value": "\"The Glory of Living,\" by Rebecca Gilman, is a riveting theatrical journey inspired by the unsettling truths of true crime. Delving into the darkest corners of human nature, Gilman's narrative courageously confronts themes of abuse, violence, & possibilities or not of redemption."
