    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "IF SOLD OUT LIMITED TICKETS WILL BE AVAILABLE AT THE DOOR ON A FIRST COME FIRST SERVE BASIS.\nNo assigned seating.\n\nThey'll be a brand new play every hour on the hour. \nCome for one or stay for all five! \nFestival will run from 6pm-11pm with 5 short 10minute intermissions in between the shows!"
